Z||000000||polomeno||01-09-2001||09:57 AM||||Well in just over 3 weeks of getting my 84 coupe of the road after some guy had it sitting for about 5 years , so after a whole summer of repairs and about $3000 in parts my  coupe lasted 3 weeks on the road before it blew a rod right threw the engine...even better i was on a trip about 500 Km from home  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ... dunno if it's worth fixing now..||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||01-09-2001||10:59 AM||||Sorry to hear the bad news  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I guess you can always look for a new or low mile 4 banger, but now would be a good time to consider a 2.8L swap or more.  With what you've got invested already, it sounds like it's a worthwhile Fiero to bringback to life.  Hope things work out for you...||||reg||1
