Z||000003||DavidHenshaw||01-09-2001||01:52 PM||||$3,000 in parts, that's a lot of money. I hope most of that went for things not related to the engine. Like the other guy said, I would consider this an opportunity to put in a 2.8 V6. You will be amazed at the power difference. Your little '84 will feel like its on steroids. Good luck.<P>Dave<P>86 GT||||reg||1
